### ---------------------------
###  Utilisateurs (admin only)
### ---------------------------

### Lister tous les utilisateurs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Créer un utilisateur
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "sismail",
    "email": "jean@gmail.com",
    "role": "user",
    "password": "motdepasse123"
}

### ---------------------------
###  Magasins (auth requis)
### ---------------------------

### Lister les magasins
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Détails d'un magasin
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Créer un magasin (admin only)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Magasin b",
    "location": "rabat"
}

### Modifier un magasin (admin only)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Magasin A "
}

### Désactiver un magasin (admin only)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/stores/{{storeId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Réactiver un magasin (admin only)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/stores/{{storeId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------
###  Gestionnaires (admin only)
### ---------------------------

### Créer un gestionnaire
POST http://localhost:3000/api/managers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "abderrahim ghmouch",
    "email": "abderrahin@gmail.com",
    "password": "qwert9822",
    "storeId": "{{storeId}}"
}

### Affecter un gestionnaire à un magasin
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/managers/{{managerId}}/store
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "storeId": "{{storeId}}"
}

### ---------------------------
###  Profil (utilisateur connecté)
### ---------------------------

### Voir mon profil
GET http://localhost:3000/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modifier mon profil
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "albert"
}

### Changer mon mot de passe
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currentPassword": "ancien_mot_de_passe",
    "newPassword": "nouveau_mot_de_passe"
}